					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/kiryu-labs-roach-wrangling-log</guid>
				<title>Kiryu Labs Roach Wrangling Log</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/kiryu-labs-roach-wrangling-log</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to all &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Researchers&lt;/span&gt; Roach Wranglers:&lt;/strong&gt; Please include your name and department on all records, along with brief description of the Roach Instance observed. Be sure to correctly process any Roach Instance encountered. Kiryu Labs is not responsible for any irresponsible Roach Wrangling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer to documents &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-723-j&quot;&gt;SCP-723-J&lt;/a&gt; and/or &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-724-j&quot;&gt;SCP-724-J&lt;/a&gt; as necessary. Interview logs are optional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kiryu Labs thanks you for your assistance with anomalous item cache processing, and is always welcoming to new interns and researchers who wish to gain additional experience within the Foundation experimental chamber environments! For additional assignments, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/kiryu-labs-hub&quot;&gt;Dr. Riven Mercer&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Display&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;format&amp;nbsp;coding.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Close&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;format&amp;nbsp;coding.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;**Encounter&amp;#32;#:**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;**Roach&amp;#32;Instance:**&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;**Personnel&amp;#32;Name/Dept:**&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;**Description:**&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interview log format:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;
&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt; __**Roach Name Intake Log Interview**__
&amp;gt; 
&amp;gt; **Dr. Name:**
&amp;gt; 
&amp;gt; **Roach Name:**
&amp;gt; 
&amp;gt; **Dr. Name:**
&amp;gt; 
&amp;gt; **Roach Name:**
&amp;gt; 
&amp;gt; **Dr. Name:** Roach name, no/no.../NO!/NOOO&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Show&amp;nbsp;Roach&amp;nbsp;Logs,&amp;nbsp;Encounters&amp;nbsp;1&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
