&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dryad Roach:&lt;/strong&gt; What makes you say that? I&#039;ve been in love with life since I was a wee cock roach. Did you know that 3.5 billion to 7 billion trees are cut down each year?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Westrin:&lt;/strong&gt; Dryad Roach, no, I didn&#039;t know that!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
