&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encounter #:&lt;/strong&gt;30&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Roach Instance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maenad Roach&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Personnel Name/Dept:&lt;/strong&gt; Agent Gummy_Dragon&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Maenad Roach loves to party. Its anomaly manifests in its ability to ingest large amounts of alcohol and its &#039;rage&#039; state. When in a rage state, Maenad roach should not be approached, and the surrounding area quarantined. Firearms, though ineffective, have been used to deter Maenad Roach.&lt;/p&gt;
