&lt;strong&gt;Personnel Name/Dept:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Graham&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Plagiarism Roach is an anomaly of its kind for obvious reasons. The object is considered an Apollyon-level threat.&lt;/p&gt;
