&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plagiarism Roach:&lt;/strong&gt; No shit, Sherlock.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Graham:&lt;/strong&gt; What kind of gig is this?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plagiarism Roach:&lt;/strong&gt; It&#039;s in the name, bud. I saw that Unique and Rebel Roach had a thing going on, and they were ripping off &lt;em&gt;each other&lt;/em&gt;, so I might as well jump on the bandwagon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Graham:&lt;/strong&gt; Plagiarism Roach, NO!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
