&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-3035-190:&lt;/strong&gt; [Proceeds to transform into an AK-47 and fire at Dr. Graham. Dr. Graham manages to dive behind his desk.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Graham:&lt;/strong&gt; COLLAB ROACH, NO! YOU&#039;RE WORSE THAN OCA&amp;#8212; OCATH&amp;#8212; FUCK, THAT OTHER ONE!&lt;/p&gt;
