&lt;strong&gt;Roach Instance:&lt;/strong&gt; Padded Roach&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Personnel Name/Dept:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Fox&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Entity appears to be covered in 1cm of wool padding, colored teal. It should be noted that Padded Roach was recovered from a shipping crate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
